y constraints. ConversationMember is a parallel membership projection; participantIds remains a canonical contract. User IDs refer to User Service. No RagTrace entity exists in the current local AI schema; Langfuse holds monitoring snapshots. conversation: conversationId: Prisma Mongo association (declared Mongo ORM relation, not SQL FK); conversation: conversationId: Prisma Mongo association (declared Mongo ORM relation, not SQL FK); summary context: conversationId UNIQUE: logical one summary per conversation (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); source conversation: optional sourceConversationId (logical provenance) (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); share context: conversationId: cross-service share context (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); linked message: messageId: optional until Reel message linked (scalar-ID association; no declared FK)"><root><mxCell id="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="E05-ai-conversation-e1" value="conversation" edge="1" parent="1" source="Message" target="Conversation" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;html=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);strokeWidth=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=0.8399999999999997;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;endArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);labelBackgroundColor=none;labelBorderColor=none;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" sourceEvidence="[&quot;backend:apps/conversation-service/prisma/schema.prisma:95-147&quot;]" relationKind="association" enforcement="declared relation"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" x="-0.21985301992355555" y="-15.0"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1217.5839999999998" y="773.374944" /><mxPoint x="1067.984" y="773.374944" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="E05-ai-conversation-e1_multiplicity0" value="0..*" vertex="1" parent="E05-ai-conversation-e1" style="text;htm