size is 80 UTF-16 code units. Token send is not awaited and does not imply receipt before final RPC or persistence.&quot;,&quot;Last verifier route names the actual conditional-edge selection, captured before the failure handler can replace answer/verification state.&quot;,&quot;Token-consumer operand has no dependency requiring it to drain before the foreground RPC/save/final new_message path.&quot;]}" conformance="OMG UML 2.5.1 documented subset" scopeDescription="Bounded verifier and separate citation revisions; independent token events and durable final reply." sourceNotes="[&quot;maxAnswerRevisions and maxCitationRevisions are independent config values (default 1, bounded 0..2); minConfidence defaults 0.65 and coverage threshold 1.&quot;, &quot;citationNeeded := REEL_VIDEO_QUESTION &amp;&amp; allowsGroundedGeneration &amp;&amp; nonempty answer &amp;&amp; nonempty citation candidates.&quot;, &quot;Verification failure/no-context can produce nonempty refusal or guarded rescue text that is streamed and saved; they do not automatically mean bot_reply_failed.&quot;, &quot;A failed answer-quality check can still route to citations at sufficient confidence after its permitted revision; the exact router guard is preserved.&quot;, &quot;Existing answer chunk size is 80 UTF-16 code units. Token send is not awaited and does not imply receipt before final RPC or persistence.&quot;, &quot;Last verifier route names the actual conditional-edge selection, captured before the failure handler can replace answer/verification state.&quot;, &quot;Token-consumer operand has no dependency requiring it to drain before the foreground RPC/save/final new_message path.&quot;]"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="s31" value="alt" vertex="1" parent="1" style="shape=umlFrame;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);strokeWidth=1;fontColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;;fontFamily